783
01:33:57.098 --> 01:34:04.098
Are you building with gold, silver, marble, and precious stones?

784
01:34:04.098 --> 01:34:08.098
Or are you building with wood or straw?

785
01:34:08.098 --> 01:34:12.098
And don't be too quick to say, this is quite good.

786
01:34:12.098 --> 01:34:17.098
For through all those influences that Debbie talks about,

787
01:34:17.098 --> 01:34:24.098
there is a constant attack on our thinking and we easily go along with the world,

788
01:34:24.098 --> 01:34:26.098
without often realizing it ourselves.

789
01:34:26.098 --> 01:34:28.098
And then we think, we are doing quite well.

790
01:34:28.098 --> 01:34:32.098
Or if you compare yourself to other people, you might think, you are doing quite well.

791
01:34:32.098 --> 01:34:36.098
But it is very important to do that self-reflection,

792
01:34:36.098 --> 01:34:40.098
that Holy Spirit reflection, as Debbie calls it.

793
01:34:40.098 --> 01:34:44.098
To indeed do that regularly and preferably every day.

794
01:34:44.098 --> 01:34:48.098
Grab the Bible, for the Holy Spirit who dwells in you,

795
01:34:48.098 --> 01:34:54.098
uses God's Word to guide you.

796
01:34:55.098 --> 01:35:03.098
The Bible, through the Holy Spirit, is the counterforce against those influences of the world.

797
01:35:03.098 --> 01:35:13.098
For where you might not notice it, the Holy Spirit can bring it to your mind.

798
01:35:13.098 --> 01:35:15.098
Jesus said, the Holy Spirit must come.

799
01:35:15.098 --> 01:35:19.098
He will bring to your mind all that I have said.

800
01:35:19.098 --> 01:35:22.098
So it may sometimes be that you simply do not realize,

801
01:35:22.098 --> 01:35:27.098
that you are building completely wrong on a part of your life.

802
01:35:27.098 --> 01:35:31.098
And then you come across it in the Bible and suddenly it jumps out at you.

803
01:35:31.098 --> 01:35:34.098
Then the Holy Spirit is speaking to you.

804
01:35:36.098 --> 01:35:40.098
We are all sinners, we live in a sinful world, we all make mistakes.

805
01:35:40.098 --> 01:35:48.098
In other words, we are all occasionally building a part of our lives with wood and straw.

806
01:35:49.098 --> 01:35:53.098
And then you realize it, because the Holy Spirit reveals it to you.

807
01:35:54.098 --> 01:35:57.098
What do you do then? You go to God.

808
01:35:57.098 --> 01:35:59.098
You say, Lord, I have done it wrong.

809
01:35:59.098 --> 01:36:01.098
Will You forgive me?

810
01:36:01.098 --> 01:36:03.098
I thank You for the cross.

811
01:36:03.098 --> 01:36:07.098
I thank You for the blood that You have shed for me.

812
01:36:07.098 --> 01:36:11.098
I thank You that You forgive me and give grace.

813
01:36:11.098 --> 01:36:14.098
Help me to do better from now on.

814
01:36:14.098 --> 01:36:19.098
And then maybe the next day or a week later it goes wrong again.

815
01:36:19.098 --> 01:36:21.098
Then you go back to Jesus.

816
01:36:21.098 --> 01:36:23.098
Lord, forgive me.

817
01:36:23.098 --> 01:36:27.098
When the disciple asked Jesus how should I actually pray?

818
01:36:27.098 --> 01:36:31.098
Then Jesus gave a wonderful example prayer.

819
01:36:31.098 --> 01:36:34.098
And it simply says in there.

820
01:36:34.098 --> 01:36:38.098
Father, forgive me as I forgive others.

821
01:36:39.098 --> 01:36:43.098
It is fine to pray every day when you see again.

822
01:36:43.098 --> 01:36:45.098
I have done wrong again for a moment.

823
01:36:45.098 --> 01:36:47.098
I have built incorrectly again for a moment.

824
01:36:47.098 --> 01:36:48.098
Forgive me.

825
01:36:48.098 --> 01:36:50.098
And do not lead me into temptation.

826
01:36:50.098 --> 01:36:52.098
But deliver me from evil.

827
01:36:52.098 --> 01:36:55.098
Or rather that sinfulness around me.

828
01:36:55.098 --> 01:36:58.098
Protect me from that and help me to do what is right.

829
01:37:00.098 --> 01:37:03.098
Maybe you think you are building quite well.

830
01:37:03.098 --> 01:37:12.098
But even if you build with good solid materials on the wrong foundation, it will go wrong at some point.

831
01:37:12.098 --> 01:37:14.098
In the storm, it will come to a head.

832
01:37:14.098 --> 01:37:16.098
And those storms come in your life.

833
01:37:16.098 --> 01:37:21.098
For sometimes it is a truly rotten world we live in.

834
01:37:21.098 --> 01:37:23.098
How beautiful God has made it.

835
01:37:23.098 --> 01:37:26.098
Sinfulness is so mean.

836
01:37:26.098 --> 01:37:28.098
The storms come in your life.

837
01:37:28.098 --> 01:37:31.098
And then it is so important that you stand firm.

838
01:37:31.098 --> 01:37:34.098
When everything is going well and fine, it doesn't matter much.

839
01:37:34.098 --> 01:37:40.098
But when that storm comes, you only realize whether you sink deep into misery or whether you stand tall because you have built on the foundation.

840
01:37:40.098 --> 01:37:45.098


841
01:37:45.098 --> 01:37:48.098
The foundation is our rock Jesus Christ.

842
01:37:48.098 --> 01:37:51.098
May I have the prayer of repentance on the screen?

843
01:37:52.098 --> 01:37:53.098
Really.

844
01:37:53.098 --> 01:37:57.098
Maybe you don't know Jesus at all or not very well yet.

845
01:37:57.098 --> 01:38:01.098
But He loves you and He wants what is good for you.

846
01:38:01.098 --> 01:38:06.098
And He is the only one who knows what good building material is.

847
01:38:06.098 --> 01:38:13.098
He is the only one who can show you the way to lead a meaningful, peaceful life.

848
01:38:13.098 --> 01:38:17.098
And later to come to the Father for eternity.

849
01:38:17.098 --> 01:38:19.098
So build your life on Him.

850
01:38:19.098 --> 01:38:22.098
If you want to follow Jesus.

851
01:38:22.098 --> 01:38:25.098
If you say yes, I make a choice again.

852
01:38:25.098 --> 01:38:27.098
Or for the first time a choice.

853
01:38:27.098 --> 01:38:29.098
I will build well from now on.

854
01:38:29.098 --> 01:38:33.098
I see that shaky mess that I have built here and there in my life.

855
01:38:33.098 --> 01:38:36.098
I will do that differently starting today.

856
01:38:36.098 --> 01:38:38.098
Would you like to pray with me?

857
01:38:38.098 --> 01:38:40.098
Thank you, Jesus.

858
01:38:40.098 --> 01:38:43.098
I believe that you are the Son of God.

859
01:38:43.098 --> 01:38:44.098
I need a moment.

860
01:38:44.098 --> 01:38:48.098
I believe that you died on the cross for my sin.

861
01:38:48.098 --> 01:38:50.098
Forgive me all my mistakes.

862
01:38:50.098 --> 01:38:53.098
I invite you into my life Jesus.

863
01:38:53.098 --> 01:38:55.098
Give me a new start.

864
01:38:55.098 --> 01:38:57.098
Help me to live for you.

865
01:38:57.098 --> 01:39:00.098
From today on, I am a child of God.

866
01:39:00.098 --> 01:39:02.098
Amen.

867
01:39:07.098 --> 01:39:08.098
Really true.

868
01:39:08.098 --> 01:39:11.098
You will discover it as you follow Jesus.

869
01:39:11.098 --> 01:39:13.098
There is nothing more beautiful.

870
01:39:13.098 --> 01:39:15.098
He is the most precious thing that exists.

871
01:39:15.098 --> 01:39:18.098
Have a very nice and blessed week everyone.

872
01:39:18.098 --> 01:39:22.098
Make sure you build your life every day.

873
01:39:22.098 --> 01:39:26.098
A little bit better with the right materials.
